### Right Rail Tick Behavior

| State | Visual | Behavior |
|---|---|---|
| `default` | Short horizontal line | Static |
| `active` | Filled dot/circle | Marks card in viewport |
| `hover` | No change to tick | Floating popup: compact entry preview (date, hospital, diagnosis) |
| `click` | Becomes active | Scrolls left panel to that card |

**Sync rule:** Left panel scroll → IntersectionObserver → updates active tick.

