## 7. Chatbot Wellbeing Greeting (Revised — User Feedback Applied)

The chatbot does **NOT** announce the prescription details. It simply opens with:

> `"How are you feeling today?"`

Immediately below, the **UI** (not the LLM) renders a read-only health status card fetched from the timeline:

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  📋 Your Recent Health Status            │
│  Visited CHC Nemmara on 20 Sep 2022      │
│  Diagnosed with: URTI                    │
│  Prescribed by: Dr. Nithin Narayanan     │
│  Active treatment: Day 3 of 5 days       │
└──────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

The LLM uses the injected context to answer follow-up questions accurately, but the greeting stays minimal and human.

